{"parse": {"title": "13TH-22", "pageid": 139657, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-21\" title=\"13TH-21\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">13TH-22</span><a href=\"/wiki/13TH-23\" title=\"13TH-23\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">13TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">22</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.B8.BD.E5.AD.90.E7.9A.84.E6.84.BF.E6.9C.9B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"鸽子的愿望\">鸽子的愿望</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 鸽子的愿望</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Wishing for Peace</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>请<span class=\"color-value\"></span>别<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>记<span class=\"color-value\"></span>每<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>你<span class=\"color-value\"></span>飞<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>鸽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>还<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>从<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>方<span class=\"color-value\"></span>衔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>橄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>榄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>树<span class=\"color-value\"></span>枝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11322</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#6C675A\"><span style=\"font-size:127%\">距离“暴雨”落下还剩—— </span> </span>                                                            <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"color:#6C675A\"><span style=\"font-size:127%\">距离“暴雨”落下还剩—— </span> </span>                                                            <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_06.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_06\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_06\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-3_7_at_06.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_06.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-3_7_at_06.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_06.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Cg-3_7_at_06.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_06.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……时间与命运交织不休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……时间是命运的一个喻体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去已逝，现在只是夹缝中的一瞬，而未来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……未来已由我明见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，你还能听见我的声音吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我……十四行诗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/HeadIconSmall-507220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我在这儿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周身被金色丝线缠绕，方向感还在失陷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只能凭借直觉伸出手——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>抓到你了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>错乱的时空骤然收缩，熟悉的出发地在眼前逐渐成型。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你……看见了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们做到了，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>做到了……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>阿尔卡纳离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你真的见到阿尔卡纳了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>是……我能听到祂在对我说话。祂说……我醒了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我试着挥开阿尔卡纳的雾气，之后不久祂就消失了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>但这种感觉不太好……我完全不明白自己到底做了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我相信终有一天你能掌握的……这、这看起来简直就是神明的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我会的。不过眼下，我们必须尽快找办法回到现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们现在在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我们好像回到图书馆了，是我们出发时的那间自习室……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>形象与声音逐渐由四面八方涌来，凝聚成型。在空无一人的空间中，逐渐出现了闪烁的人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她听到了再熟悉不过的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这是在顿河调查时，伊戈尔交给我的东西。他称呼它为‘奇迹’。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“这颗立方体中或许存在着某种能在‘暴雨’中提供庇护的力量，但……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，我看到了……我们，还有梅蕾尔。这是我们准备开启“奇迹”的时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>什么？也就是说，很快我们就会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与预料中的相同，那扇黑暗的门扉再度出现在眼前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>果然，她们……不，是我们打开了这扇门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaokeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，我想我知道走出这里的方法了……带我去门边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你知道——好的，在这边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>接近门边时，身体却感觉到了强大的斥力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>果然，门从里面是打不开的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这扇门应该只能“从外向内”开启。也就是说，要有外面的人穿过这扇门，我们才能借机走出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——进入这扇门，十四行诗，还有……维尔汀！你必须和十四行诗一起进来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>起先她并不确定声音能否穿透黑门，但过去的回忆带来了确定的答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰，“我们”准备穿过黑门了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们要同时进出，抓住机会，十四行诗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗等待着，直到过去与未来走到交汇点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“‘暴雨’前的最后一刻，我们都要平安地回到图书馆，在这里前往新的时代。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“嗯，约好了。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“我们出发吧，十四行诗。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507217.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507217.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3f/HeadIconSmall-507217.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507217.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——司辰！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>过去与未来的人擦肩而过，时间的首尾之衔已然完成。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>再一次，凭空出现的尘埃席卷万物。黑暗和沉默灌入感官。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_45.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_45\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_45\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_7_bg_45.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_45.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_7_bg_45.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_45.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/Cg-3_7_bg_45.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_45.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我在，司辰，我们回到了原本的年龄，你能看清东西了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我的视力也恢复了，我们应该已经回到了现实。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>太好了……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在房间正中央，黑暗的门扉已经消失，它退缩为原本的样子——悬浮着的黑色“魔盒”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>距离“暴雨”落下还有三分钟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>维尔汀小姐，十四行诗小姐？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……拉文德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>太好了，我听见房间里有声音，果然是你们回来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯，图书馆的情况怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>现在……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>拉文德走向门外。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"xuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>学生们几乎全都挤在自习室外的藏书区里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-532511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-532511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/HeadIconSmall-532511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾米莉亚：</div><div>这些鸽子……比我们带回来的时候更暗了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们沉默地守在一小堆光芒黯淡的石鸽子旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仍然昏迷不醒的玛蒂尔达也被学生们带到了这里，气象鸽的黯淡光芒给她的身体打上一层模糊的光影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532218.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-532218.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532218.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532218.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-532218.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532218.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-532218.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532218.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>免疫区已经不包括图书馆了。多亏两个从中央瞭望塔过来的学生带回了备用的气象鸽，我们才撑到现在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-532211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-532211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/81/HeadIconSmall-532211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>他们说，是梅蕾尔小姐让他们把鸽子赶快带回来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>可是它们的光也快要熄灭了，我害怕我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>别担心，拉文德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我得到了能够让大家度过这次“暴雨”的庇护。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_37.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_37\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_37\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/Cg-3_7_bg_37.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_37.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531726.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531726.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她曾经见过“暴雨”落下的时刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但不像现在——世界在眼前碎裂，她身处其中，既没有身处安全的庇护所内，也无法撑起一把平衡伞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531727.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531727.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>雨水……在倒流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>肾上腺素的浪潮逐渐退去，受伤的双腿发出撕心裂肺的哀嚎，抗拒着跑完通往图书馆的最后一段路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>嘿，嘿嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531726.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531726.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-531726.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531726.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>维尔汀和十四行诗成功了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>我们要得救了，快跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531727.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531727.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>要……得救了？可是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>别可是了，我们真的要得救了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……我快走不动了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我知道“暴雨”是怎么回事，当雨水开始倒流，做什么都晚了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我甚至能看见你。我不应该看见这种幻觉的，是暴雨症候……我一定是要死了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>别放弃，梅蕾尔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>跑到图书馆去，用光你所有的力气，我们还能活下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>——快看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531727.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531727.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e5/HeadIconSmall-531727.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531727.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她艰难地仰起头，视线中的一切都被倒流的雨水模糊。建筑正诡异地在雨中燃烧，树木、高墙甚至是天空都在被撕碎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可是图书馆的一部分屹立不倒，她看到有阵阵光辉正从面向广场的门扉与窗户中泄出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>图书馆……好远啊……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我第一次参加体育测试的时候，就没能一口气跑到操场尽头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>但现在不一样了，梅蕾尔！我们比过去要高大多了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅蕾尔：</div><div>跑吧，梅蕾尔！跑起来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531728.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-531728.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531728.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531728.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-531728.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531728.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2a/HeadIconSmall-531728.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531728.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>不要走到光的外面，大家都靠在一起！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">拉文德：</div><div>都到维尔汀小姐身边来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>梅蕾尔……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>她还没有回来？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔？：</div><div>快，梅蕾尔。快跑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔？：</div><div>我们成功了，我们现在是第一防线学校的英雄了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔？：</div><div>维尔汀她们回来了，所有人都在图书馆等我们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>维尔汀？她们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那是——梅蕾尔？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我就快……只差一点儿……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>我还想……活下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅蕾尔：</div><div>不要……抛下我，维尔——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不，梅蕾尔！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "13TH-22"}}